<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Bangla translations of the user-facing labels Salah's calendar, Ramadan and navigation surfaces use.

  This is a partial translation on purpose. Android falls back to values/strings.xml for anything not
  listed here, and Salah's English wording makes specific claims about sources and limits that must not
  be translated loosely — so the strings translated here are the ones whose meaning is unambiguous
  (names of calendars, months, prayers and observance, and short navigation labels). The explanatory
  paragraphs that state what is estimated and what is not stay in English until they can be reviewed.

  Salah does not switch language from inside the app; these are selected by the device locale, and the
  calendar's own date language is a separate, explicit setting (see Calendar settings).
-->
